      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "The message from one American League front office executive as he departed the GM meetings in Nevada this week was clear. “Keep your phone handy at Thanksgiving,” he said. On a fast-moving market ahead of a lockout, from me and Kyle Williams: www.thebanner.com/sports/oriol...",
