      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Tough night for the Royals prospects. Lamkin had three errors behind him and threw a wild pitch to get roughed up for five in two innings, and Rose (who did walk twice) grounded into a rally-ending double play. Still, fun season!",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "novacarmina.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "パドレス、マリナーズ、オリオールズ、レッズ、カージナルスの有望株で組んだピオリアが、今夜AFLの優勝を決めた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "garyhphillips.bsky.social",
      "author": "Gary Phillips",
      "team": "ヤンキース",
      "outlet": "New York Daily News",
      "text": "The #Yankees have made their first move to address a barren bullpen, agreeing to a one-year, $2.25 million deal with Tim Hill. It comes with a $2.5 million club option for 2028, sources confirm. Hill is coming off a down year, but the Bombers' bullpen is in need of arms.",
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-15T16:11:06.136Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:k6souhooieuhazcostyw342c/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2efodkghc2k",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "#ヤンキース がブルペン補強の第一弾として、ティム・ヒルと1年225万ドルで合意。2028年は250万ドルの球団オプション付きと複数の関係者が認めた。ヒルは昨季不調だったが、ブルペンは戦力が足りていない。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "garyhphillips.bsky.social",
      "author": "Gary Phillips",
      "team": "ヤンキース",
      "outlet": "New York Daily News",
      "text": "A few leftover notes from the GM Meetings: ⚾️ Omar Minaya & Brian Sabean weren't retained as \"costs continue to stretch.\" Really? ⚾️ Jasson Domínguez took it upon himself to play winter ball with his #Yankees future uncertain ⚾️ Tim Hill is getting lots of interest ⚾️ Carlos Lagrange's outlook",
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-14T14:54:16.883Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:k6souhooieuhazcostyw342c/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2bqw2ezes2k",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "GMミーティングのこぼれ話。⚾️オマー・ミナヤとブライアン・サビーンは「コストが膨らみ続けるなか」で残留せず。本当に? ⚾️ヤンキースでの将来が不透明なハッソン・ドミンゲスは自らウインターリーグ参戦を決断 ⚾️ティム・ヒルに多くの関心 ⚾️カルロス・ラグランジュの見通し"
    },
    {
