      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Mets relief prospect Ryan Lambert got back on track in the Fall League, in part because he started incorporating a sweeper that he believes could trigger some control improvements. www.mlb.com/news/mets-pr...",
